5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m a bit nervous about the new fee structure. Can we look at the ledger and the treasurer’s hours first?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to verify the actual income before setting costs. I will review the bank statements and the mid-year joiner records.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I want to understand the attendance patterns. I will check the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m curious about why people hesitate to commit. I’ll check the taster forms and the winter social feedback.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll pull the weekday turnout figures and the ledger. We need to see if the costs are fixed or if they actually track with who shows up.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, do the bank statements show if people are struggling to pay?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Not yet. I’m still cross-referencing the mid-year joiner calculations. I’ll confirm the payment delays once I finish the ledger check.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, the sign-in sheets show a quarter of members account for two-thirds of attendances.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minako, that’s a stark imbalance. I’m hoping the taster forms reveal why newcomers hesitate to commit to a full year upfront.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minako, that imbalance is exactly what I suspected. I’ll confirm if the same nine people are also doing the setup work.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, that sounds worrying. I hope the treasurer’s hours show the job isn’t too heavy for the next person.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minato, the ledger confirms fixed costs dominate. I’m still verifying the mid-year calculations, but the income picture is clearer now.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shunichi, if the same nine people are doing the setup, that confirms the workload is concentrated. I need to know if that affects how we structure the fees.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minako, the taster forms show people fear a full-year commitment. I want to know if the winter social feedback matches that hesitation.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minako, the rota confirms it. The same nine people handle setup and lock-up. The workload is heavily concentrated, not shared.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, if the ledger shows fixed costs, does that mean the treasurer’s job is mostly chasing individual payments? I worry about the burden.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minato, the ledger shows fixed costs, but the treasurer’s hours will reveal the administrative burden. I’ll confirm the payment delays shortly.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Shunichi, that concentration is a problem. If the fee structure doesn’t account for that, we risk losing those nine people entirely.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"@Minako, the winter social feedback confirms it. People feel uneasy about the cost per visit. We need a structure that feels fair, not just cheap.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minako, the concentration is the problem. We need a structure that reflects actual usage, not just who shows up.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
